  ('83a7c53b-2b74-429b-85a7-b3b666b6e985', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'CONTRAINDICATIONS/CAUTIONS: pregnancy (traditionally regarded as an abortifacient/uterine stimulant — avoid) and breastfeeding (insufficient data — avoid) | Avoid in pregnancy (traditionally considered an abortifacient) and while breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3d38cc44-a004-4414-9cc2-93ee6dcb633c, b0669d95-d3e5-4841-9c2f-892a7a82ed31, 23b86ca9-8db2-49e0-8fa1-70468f394ea2, 09be7cda-0a86-4c29-9818-df38d2a32c46; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ashwagandha
  ('83a7c53b-2b74-429b-85a7-b3b666b6e985', 'liver', 'avoid', 'Serious concern: multiple post-marketing case reports of ashwagandha-associated liver injury (hepatotoxicity), sometimes with jaundice — avoid with pre-existing liver disease and stop if signs of liver trouble appear. | SERIOUS but rare signal: idiosyncratic hepatotoxicity (herb-induced liver injury', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3d38cc44-a004-4414-9cc2-93ee6dcb633c, b0669d95-d3e5-4841-9c2f-892a7a82ed31, bb8a5d38-2eb5-4d5f-a7eb-1c8937374d40, 23b86ca9-8db2-49e0-8fa1-70468f394ea2, 09be7cda-0a86-4c29-9818-df38d2a32c46, 79439568-0d31-42c1-b3ce-0b9c08b5eb50, 4f1bbe52-a46f-472d-96ca-f8cce754de10; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ashwagandha
  ('83a7c53b-2b74-429b-85a7-b3b666b6e985', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy (traditionally considered an abortifacient) and while breastfeeding. | CONTRAINDICATIONS/CAUTIONS: pregnancy (traditionally regarded as an abortifacient/uterine stimulant — avoid) and breastfeeding (insufficient data — avoid)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3d38cc44-a004-4414-9cc2-93ee6dcb633c, b0669d95-d3e5-4841-9c2f-892a7a82ed31, bb8a5d38-2eb5-4d5f-a7eb-1c8937374d40, 23b86ca9-8db2-49e0-8fa1-70468f394ea2, 09be7cda-0a86-4c29-9818-df38d2a32c46, 79439568-0d31-42c1-b3ce-0b9c08b5eb50, 4f1bbe52-a46f-472d-96ca-f8cce754de10; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ashwagandha
  ('83a7c53b-2b74-429b-85a7-b3b666b6e985', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Avoid before surgery due to sedative effects. | scheduled surgery (may potentiate sedation/anesthesia — stop ~2 weeks prior).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3d38cc44-a004-4414-9cc2-93ee6dcb633c, bb8a5d38-2eb5-4d5f-a7eb-1c8937374d40; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ashwagandha
