  ('b482b121-712e-49c3-a37e-0c65764fa61e', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/lactation: fine as dietary fat, but no safety data for concentrated therapeutic ''anti-candida'' dosing, so avoid high-dose supplementation.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ea509362-f7f6-44f9-8ac5-3848eae2ca56; signal "avoid", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- caprylic-acid
  ('b482b121-712e-49c3-a37e-0c65764fa61e', 'liver', 'caution', 'theoretical caution in advanced liver disease given hepatic MCT metabolism', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ea509362-f7f6-44f9-8ac5-3848eae2ca56; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- caprylic-acid
  ('b482b121-712e-49c3-a37e-0c65764fa61e', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/lactation: fine as dietary fat, but no safety data for concentrated therapeutic ''anti-candida'' dosing, so avoid high-dose supplementation.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ea509362-f7f6-44f9-8ac5-3848eae2ca56; signal "avoid", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- caprylic-acid
  ('dbb21c41-ef54-493a-90e0-59f3566567fa', 'children', 'avoid', 'No meaningful systemic drug interactions from topical use and systemic adverse effects are rare, but avoid on very young children without medical advice.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 6bba2b19-fd38-4f0c-934e-82bca7e9d858; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- capsaicin
  ('dbb21c41-ef54-493a-90e0-59f3566567fa', 'surgery', 'caution', 'The 8% patch causes intense transient burning and a transient rise in blood pressure from pain, so it is applied by clinicians, often with a topical local anesthetic and BP monitoring.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 6bba2b19-fd38-4f0c-934e-82bca7e9d858; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- capsaicin
