  ('ec663c7b-9e04-4d96-983f-2dc05e068f96', 'liver', 'caution', 'Ingestion of clove oil (eugenol) has caused serious pediatric poisoning - CNS depression, seizures, coma, acute hepatotoxicity/hepatic failure, DIC, and hypoglycemia, sometimes from as little as 5-10 mL in children | Even in adults, undiluted clove oil can cause mucosal/GI burns, esophageal and gast', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links cbf9d47f-3964-4b9b-904f-e8382e279c6a; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- clove
