  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'surgery', 'caution', 'caution in bleeding disorders, pre-surgery, on anticoagulants/CYP3A4-sensitive drugs, in pregnancy at medicinal doses, and in IBS/SIBO where it is a FODMAP trigger. | stop high-dose garlic ~7-10 days before surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 539101a3-d2c4-438a-a4eb-e89329320ad1, d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Pregnancy: widely used and studied for morning sickness and considered reasonably safe at food/low doses (commonly ≤1 g/day), but very high doses are not well studied — pregnant users should stay within culinary/low supplemental amounts and consult a clinician. | In pregnancy, ~1 g/day short-term is', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a0a8b10e-5e8f-4b59-a759-4b61572bb6f2, 20541e13-3e59-46ab-a76c-df5710e8de96, f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "consult", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Bleeding risk: ginger can modestly inhibit platelet aggregation, so use caution combining high-dose supplements with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, DAOCs, aspirin, clopidogrel) and stop ~1-2 weeks before surgery. | It has mild antiplatelet/anticoagulant activity, so use caution and consult ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b66150e6-390e-43b7-9c8f-2b1a4eb6aff4, a0a8b10e-5e8f-4b59-a759-4b61572bb6f2, 20541e13-3e59-46ab-a76c-df5710e8de96, f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "stop 1 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Avoid or use caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, apixaban, aspirin, clopidogrel), NSAIDs, and stop at least 1-2 weeks before surgery or dental procedures. | Bottom line: the main real risk is bleeding, especially combined with blood thinners or surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "stop at least 1 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('5b928596-1e51-44fa-96c1-7e72e03f589f', 'liver', 'caution', 'the fatty-liver signal is from one uncontrolled pilot.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7214ac0d-2d4c-4e35-95f1-c78714703bb4; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- glutathione
  ('7cb130d2-d6b1-47af-893e-0dd76b1ec415', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'limited data in pregnancy, breastfeeding, and in significant kidney or liver impairment, use caution and consult a clinician', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 53b966fe-0c69-4fe2-a98a-f50c834f4099; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glycine
  ('7cb130d2-d6b1-47af-893e-0dd76b1ec415', 'liver', 'caution', 'limited data in pregnancy, breastfeeding, and in significant kidney or liver impairment, use caution and consult a clinician', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 53b966fe-0c69-4fe2-a98a-f50c834f4099; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glycine
  ('7cb130d2-d6b1-47af-893e-0dd76b1ec415', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'limited data in pregnancy, breastfeeding, and in significant kidney or liver impairment, use caution and consult a clinician', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 53b966fe-0c69-4fe2-a98a-f50c834f4099; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glycine
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding — traditionally regarded as a potential emmenagogue/uterine stimulant | it is generally advised against in pregnancy, when trying to conceive, and while breastfeeding due to insufficient safety data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a, 49241f60-b6fd-42fc-a5f1-0963db83a331; signal "emmenagogue", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding — traditionally regarded as a potential emmenagogue/uterine stimulant | it is generally advised against in pregnancy, when trying to conceive, and while breastfeeding due to insufficient safety data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a, 49241f60-b6fd-42fc-a5f1-0963db83a331; signal "emmenagogue", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'it may add to the effect of anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel) and should typically be stopped ~2 weeks before surgery. | Bleeding/surgery — tulsi has antiplatelet activity', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a, 49241f60-b6fd-42fc-a5f1-0963db83a331; signal "stopped 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('c0806a98-21b1-4825-ad3c-ebbde8a59b3c', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'theoretical caution in hormone-sensitive conditions and NO safety data in pregnancy or breastfeeding (avoid).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links aa3111fb-0b71-4059-870f-537da4efa0fa; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- hops
  ('c0806a98-21b1-4825-ad3c-ebbde8a59b3c', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'theoretical caution in hormone-sensitive conditions and NO safety data in pregnancy or breastfeeding (avoid).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links aa3111fb-0b71-4059-870f-537da4efa0fa; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- hops
  ('443fc77f-e925-4712-839c-05bbd12e67f7', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding — myo-inositol is commonly used in pregnancy for other indications and is generally considered low-risk, but anxiety-dose safety data are lacking', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e9a2b215-0463-4e08-aef5-4de46e014e44; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- inositol
  ('443fc77f-e925-4712-839c-05bbd12e67f7', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding — myo-inositol is commonly used in pregnancy for other indications and is generally considered low-risk, but anxiety-dose safety data are lacking', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e9a2b215-0463-4e08-aef5-4de46e014e44; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- inositol
  ('ae041b66-6799-495a-9ac8-df86caab9cf1', 'children', 'avoid', 'Serious risks: acute iron overdose is a leading cause of poisoning death in young children -- keep all iron products locked away from kids.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d7d8b979-efef-4b86-bb23-66b68c95d695; signal "keep all iron products locked away from", confidence high', 'draft'), -- iron
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Who should avoid: pregnant or breastfeeding people (it is emmenagogue/uterine-active in tradition and untested — avoid) | Avoid in pregnancy/lactation and before surgery due to insufficient data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2, ae7d9593-4528-4291-9997-14e713f178a8; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Who should avoid: pregnant or breastfeeding people (it is emmenagogue/uterine-active in tradition and untested — avoid) | Avoid in pregnancy/lactation and before surgery due to insufficient data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2, ae7d9593-4528-4291-9997-14e713f178a8; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Stop before surgery (sedative + BP effects, anesthesia interaction). | Avoid in pregnancy/lactation and before surgery due to insufficient data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2, ae7d9593-4528-4291-9997-14e713f178a8; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('709d86b7-90cd-47ab-9a13-943a9131e912', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Who should avoid it: pregnant or breastfeeding women (no safety data), children/adolescents, people with bipolar disorder or a history of mania/psychosis (a mood-active serotonergic/dopaminergic agent), anyone on antidepressants or MAOIs without medical oversight, and people with significant cardiov', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8d672117-9d9c-4960-9d89-fb36946c7bee; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- kanna-sceletium
  ('709d86b7-90cd-47ab-9a13-943a9131e912', 'children', 'avoid', 'Who should avoid it: pregnant or breastfeeding women (no safety data), children/adolescents, people with bipolar disorder or a history of mania/psychosis (a mood-active serotonergic/dopaminergic agent), anyone on antidepressants or MAOIs without medical oversight, and people with significant cardiov', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8d672117-9d9c-4960-9d89-fb36946c7bee; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- kanna-sceletium
