  ('c958b4d2-dc00-48ea-b7ee-3b58f8178d86', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Not adequately studied in pregnancy/breastfeeding, in significant kidney or liver disease, or in children — avoid without a clinician.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ae2c2be1-fb41-4fb6-8c5f-00059511976d; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-citrulline
  ('31700ba6-1f47-42fc-a0bb-4257850cd204', 'kidney', 'caution', 'Kidney disease — use caution and medical supervision given altered nitrogen handling. | get physician sign-off if you have liver or kidney disease.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7dd83b11-791c-4903-af69-d9dee8ce0245; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-glutamine
  ('31700ba6-1f47-42fc-a0bb-4257850cd204', 'liver', 'avoid', 'people with hepatic encephalopathy or advanced liver failure should avoid supplemental glutamine because it can raise ammonia. | Liver disease/cirrhosis — glutamine is metabolized to glutamate and ammonia', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7dd83b11-791c-4903-af69-d9dee8ce0245; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-glutamine
  ('5ff51781-b773-467d-bfd4-6f4f29029342', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding: insufficient safety data on isolated high-dose theanine, so avoid. | Pregnancy/breastfeeding safety of concentrated supplements is not established', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f78310f1-57f0-4878-b883-a07b33831a16, a7bde884-3f70-4695-9f22-d71c861346e7, b96f0b75-00e8-4460-867c-bc49ba6e429a, e76bbe7d-1b23-4e30-834f-9177c3f84c32; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-theanine
