  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding: insufficient safety data — avoid oral therapeutic doses. | Cautions/contraindications: pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data — avoid oral use)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e700f5eb-95eb-4114-b765-00936d6ec240, 095802dd-cc8c-4be6-a213-151421a83e53, 08b4e4c6-9923-45bc-a850-3c5af8d57e04; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'children', 'avoid', 'This signal is debated and specific to topical/leave-on products in children, but warrants avoiding routine topical lavender in prepubertal children. | IMPORTANT ENDOCRINE CAUTION: case reports in the New England Journal of Medicine (Henley 2007) and an expanded case series in the Journal of Clinica', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e700f5eb-95eb-4114-b765-00936d6ec240, 095802dd-cc8c-4be6-a213-151421a83e53, 08b4e4c6-9923-45bc-a850-3c5af8d57e04; signal "avoiding", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/breastfeeding: insufficient safety data — avoid oral therapeutic doses. | Cautions/contraindications: pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data — avoid oral use)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e700f5eb-95eb-4114-b765-00936d6ec240, 095802dd-cc8c-4be6-a213-151421a83e53, 08b4e4c6-9923-45bc-a850-3c5af8d57e04; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Insufficient safety data in pregnancy and breastfeeding — avoid. | pregnancy and breastfeeding safety is not established (no adequate human studies) — best avoided.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bc00ec-84d4-443e-a486-540f21e68188, 000522f9-35eb-443d-b7fe-10a0d4dff429; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Insufficient safety data in pregnancy and breastfeeding — avoid. | pregnancy and breastfeeding safety is not established (no adequate human studies) — best avoided.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bc00ec-84d4-443e-a486-540f21e68188, 000522f9-35eb-443d-b7fe-10a0d4dff429; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'surgery', 'caution', 'Because it can be mildly sedating and may lower alertness, use caution around anesthesia — stop ~2 weeks before surgery. | May lower blood glucose (monitor if diabetic/on hypoglycemics) and has mild sedative-additive potential with barbiturate/anesthetic agents.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bc00ec-84d4-443e-a486-540f21e68188; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('cd0f08db-5ed6-4370-a0c8-06a26e06552c', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Safety data in pregnancy/breastfeeding are lacking - avoid.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 012b1b47-efb8-4e63-84bc-7ad5723a1857; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lions-mane
