  ('8e2e0162-7f31-45ae-9565-5da55622445d', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Data in pregnancy/breastfeeding are insufficient — avoid. | Long-term safety has not been established (noted explicitly by Lee 2011, PMID 21840656), and safety in pregnancy/breastfeeding is not established.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0de64efe-8cce-4dcc-8909-dcb6d7361d94, bd66b037-84ce-4d67-9d80-699d5d38404d; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- maca
  ('8e2e0162-7f31-45ae-9565-5da55622445d', 'liver', 'caution', 'A 90-day human safety study noted a moderate rise in AST (a liver enzyme) and diastolic blood pressure with maca powder ~0.6 g/day (PMID 18054420) — monitor in people with liver disease or hypertension.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0de64efe-8cce-4dcc-8909-dcb6d7361d94; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- maca
