  ('c0e806a6-4850-4393-ada7-f374f2a87510', 'bleeding_risk', 'caution', 'Caution in active peptic ulcer disease and asthma. | Contraindications/cautions: use caution in asthma (bronchospasm risk) and active peptic ulcer disease', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 40befcd0-fc41-4e9c-a16f-0911c4d53592, ee909004-aa78-43dd-bd22-4ccfa270209b; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- nac
  ('c0e806a6-4850-4393-ada7-f374f2a87510', 'surgery', 'caution', 'it may have mild antiplatelet/blood-thinning effects, so caution with anticoagulants and before surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ee909004-aa78-43dd-bd22-4ccfa270209b; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- nac
  ('92327cd9-8d29-426e-81a1-a19bb66b9a55', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'AVOID: infants/children (especially the oil), pregnant/breastfeeding women, people trying to conceive, those with liver disease, and organ-transplant/autoimmune patients on immune-modifying therapy without clinician oversight.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 61955a75-c2bc-4839-921b-4893556ba49e; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- neem
  ('92327cd9-8d29-426e-81a1-a19bb66b9a55', 'children', 'avoid', 'neem oil should never be given orally to babies/children and ingestion can be fatal. | Neem seed OIL is the highest-risk form — it has caused toxic/metabolic encephalopathy and a Reye''s-like syndrome (vomiting, drowsiness, seizures, metabolic acidosis, hepatic injury), especially in INFANTS and youn', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 61955a75-c2bc-4839-921b-4893556ba49e, 9dd21c55-ffd8-4b3b-90f2-417fb070579a; signal "fatal", confidence high', 'draft'), -- neem
  ('92327cd9-8d29-426e-81a1-a19bb66b9a55', 'kidney', 'caution', 'In a controlled animal study, neem leaf suspension at higher oral doses DECREASED heart/pulse/respiratory rate and caused histologic lung congestion and degeneration (plus liver/kidney injury) — a direct wrong-direction signal for respiratory support.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 61955a75-c2bc-4839-921b-4893556ba49e; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- neem
  ('92327cd9-8d29-426e-81a1-a19bb66b9a55', 'liver', 'caution', 'Neem seed OIL is the highest-risk form — it has caused toxic/metabolic encephalopathy and a Reye''s-like syndrome (vomiting, drowsiness, seizures, metabolic acidosis, hepatic injury), especially in INFANTS and young children | Hepatotoxicity and elevated liver enzymes reported at higher/prolonged dos', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 61955a75-c2bc-4839-921b-4893556ba49e, 9dd21c55-ffd8-4b3b-90f2-417fb070579a; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- neem
  ('92327cd9-8d29-426e-81a1-a19bb66b9a55', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'REPRODUCTIVE: Neem has documented anti-fertility/abortifacient and spermicidal activity — CONTRAINDICATED in pregnancy, when trying to conceive, and in men concerned about fertility. | AVOID: infants/children (especially the oil), pregnant/breastfeeding women, people trying to conceive, those with l', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 61955a75-c2bc-4839-921b-4893556ba49e, 9dd21c55-ffd8-4b3b-90f2-417fb070579a; signal "abortifacient", confidence high', 'draft'), -- neem
  ('637e3968-1484-4880-acab-d67f30417f5e', 'liver', 'caution', 'Rare contact/allergic dermatitis and rare hepatotoxicity reports with concentrated oil.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7d7b0a46-5298-4160-a313-5a2c14228587; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- nigella-black-cumin
  ('637e3968-1484-4880-acab-d67f30417f5e', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Avoid or use only with clinician oversight in pregnancy (traditional emmenagogue/uterine-stimulant concern), and use caution when combining with sedatives.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7d7b0a46-5298-4160-a313-5a2c14228587; signal "clinician oversight", confidence high', 'draft'), -- nigella-black-cumin
  ('637e3968-1484-4880-acab-d67f30417f5e', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Antiplatelet/anticoagulant effect — thymoquinone can inhibit platelet aggregation, so it may increase bleeding risk with warfarin, DOACs, aspirin/NSAIDs, or around surgery (stop ~2 weeks before surgery).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7d7b0a46-5298-4160-a313-5a2c14228587; signal "stop 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- nigella-black-cumin
  ('4a2a320b-68d1-44d4-b3c0-c82b10a2263f', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'use caution with warfarin, DOACs, aspirin/clopidogrel, and stop before elective surgery per your surgeon. | Antiplatelet/mild anticoagulant effect: modestly increases bleeding tendency at high doses — relevant for people on warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, or antiplatelet drugs, and it should generally be ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e54a6332-5787-4c80-a89a-6c23024ea1ef, f5bd2530-8bbe-4470-a418-8163cef0d0a4, baaa87e5-e5e6-44d5-acef-2290cfb9d531; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- omega-3-fish-oil
  ('c68efe6f-9bf2-4f3f-ac63-4f472897333f', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'possible teratogenicity signals in animal work) and while breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3e1e198d-c5bc-47c4-9f69-931f65f5ce54; signal "possible", confidence low', 'draft'), -- oregano-oil
  ('c68efe6f-9bf2-4f3f-ac63-4f472897333f', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy (traditional emmenagogue/uterine-stimulant reputation | possible teratogenicity signals in animal work) and while breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3e1e198d-c5bc-47c4-9f69-931f65f5ce54; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- oregano-oil
  ('c68efe6f-9bf2-4f3f-ac63-4f472897333f', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Carvacrol/thymol can inhibit platelet aggregation - use caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, DOACs, clopidogrel, aspirin) and stop before surgery due to theoretical bleeding risk.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3e1e198d-c5bc-47c4-9f69-931f65f5ce54; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- oregano-oil
  ('e366f467-f748-44b0-9061-37146404e33a', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'WHO SHOULD AVOID: pregnant/breastfeeding women, people on blood thinners or diabetes medication, and anyone who cannot verify the plant''s identity/source. | caution while breastfeeding (no safety data).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 000e3c10-2e70-422b-9d1b-653013553dab; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- osha
  ('e366f467-f748-44b0-9061-37146404e33a', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'PREGNANCY: Traditionally regarded as a uterine stimulant / emmenagogue — avoid in pregnancy and while trying to conceive | WHO SHOULD AVOID: pregnant/breastfeeding women, people on blood thinners or diabetes medication, and anyone who cannot verify the plant''s identity/source.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 000e3c10-2e70-422b-9d1b-653013553dab; signal "uterine stimulant", confidence high', 'draft'), -- osha
  ('8c26bb3a-8ee1-4c17-840a-f4c04776e6d7', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Avoid or use only with medical supervision in pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data | Limited safety data in pregnancy/breastfeeding — best avoided.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9e650cd7-b267-4f9b-9d35-209c87f82377, 15de03ff-0618-4b4e-a0a0-83a739872448, 828f553a-2c4b-4cd3-98d2-96dca0b927ef; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- panax-ginseng
  ('8c26bb3a-8ee1-4c17-840a-f4c04776e6d7', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid or use only with medical supervision in pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data | Limited safety data in pregnancy/breastfeeding — best avoided.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9e650cd7-b267-4f9b-9d35-209c87f82377, 15de03ff-0618-4b4e-a0a0-83a739872448, 828f553a-2c4b-4cd3-98d2-96dca0b927ef; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- panax-ginseng
  ('8c26bb3a-8ee1-4c17-840a-f4c04776e6d7', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'bleeding risk — ginseng has antiplatelet activity and can interact with warfarin (may reduce INR) and other anticoagulants/antiplatelets, so stop before surgery | some animal signals), in hormone-sensitive conditions (weak estrogenic activity reported), and before surgery (stop ~1 week prior due to ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9e650cd7-b267-4f9b-9d35-209c87f82377, 828f553a-2c4b-4cd3-98d2-96dca0b927ef; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- panax-ginseng
  ('0c3ed1a2-9d98-460e-b8a9-981c314ec670', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'AVOID in pregnancy (some Passiflora constituents/harman-type alkaloids are reported to have uterine-stimulant potential) and during breastfeeding due to insufficient safety data. | insufficient data in breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4e7d9e8c-b06d-4284-a7d8-dc4127eee556, 8e2e0cbf-c90d-446d-be26-0312baeea485; signal "uterine stimulant", confidence high', 'draft'), -- passionflower
  ('0c3ed1a2-9d98-460e-b8a9-981c314ec670', 'children', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in children. | EMA restricts labeled traditional use to adults and adolescents over 12.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4e7d9e8c-b06d-4284-a7d8-dc4127eee556, 8e2e0cbf-c90d-446d-be26-0312baeea485; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- passionflower
  ('0c3ed1a2-9d98-460e-b8a9-981c314ec670', 'liver', 'caution', 'Use caution in people on other sedatives, before surgery, and in those with significant liver disease (herbal products vary widely and are not standardized', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4e7d9e8c-b06d-4284-a7d8-dc4127eee556; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- passionflower
  ('0c3ed1a2-9d98-460e-b8a9-981c314ec670', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'AVOID in pregnancy (some Passiflora constituents/harman-type alkaloids are reported to have uterine-stimulant potential) and during breastfeeding due to insufficient safety data. | Avoid in pregnancy (traditional caution plus animal data: potential uterine-stimulant and developmental effects)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4e7d9e8c-b06d-4284-a7d8-dc4127eee556, 8e2e0cbf-c90d-446d-be26-0312baeea485; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- passionflower
  ('0c3ed1a2-9d98-460e-b8a9-981c314ec670', 'surgery', 'caution', 'Because it is CNS-depressant/sedating, it can add to the effects of alcohol, benzodiazepines, barbiturates, opioids, sedating antihistamines, other sedative herbs (valerian, kava), and general anesthetics — use caution around driving/machinery and disclose before surgery/anesthesia. | Use caution in', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4e7d9e8c-b06d-4284-a7d8-dc4127eee556; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- passionflower
  ('6145c3e3-d71d-4da0-b5dc-e4e8ddd91a1b', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'high-dose naphthoquinones showed embryo-fetal toxicity in animals — contraindicated in pregnancy and breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f50e9184-4507-4663-bfc7-31b971f777e3; signal "contraindicated", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pau-darco
  ('6145c3e3-d71d-4da0-b5dc-e4e8ddd91a1b', 'kidney', 'caution', 'Use caution with hepatic/renal impairment and with other drugs given the NAD(P)H:quinone-oxidoreductase and topoisomerase-related activity of its quinones.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f50e9184-4507-4663-bfc7-31b971f777e3; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pau-darco
  ('6145c3e3-d71d-4da0-b5dc-e4e8ddd91a1b', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'high-dose naphthoquinones showed embryo-fetal toxicity in animals — contraindicated in pregnancy and breastfeeding. | Bottom line: bleeding risk + pregnancy contraindication are the two hard safety limits.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f50e9184-4507-4663-bfc7-31b971f777e3; signal "contraindicated", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pau-darco
  ('6145c3e3-d71d-4da0-b5dc-e4e8ddd91a1b', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'stop before surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f50e9184-4507-4663-bfc7-31b971f777e3; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pau-darco
  ('64dcc463-1ff5-43b6-ba2b-de31a2a233e4', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'No well-documented major drug interactions, but formal interaction and long-term (>6 month) safety data are limited, and it has not been adequately studied in pregnancy or breastfeeding, so those groups should avoid it absent physician guidance.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8747fdb2-e371-47f5-a072-1104465896c1; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pea
  ('64dcc463-1ff5-43b6-ba2b-de31a2a233e4', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'No well-documented major drug interactions, but formal interaction and long-term (>6 month) safety data are limited, and it has not been adequately studied in pregnancy or breastfeeding, so those groups should avoid it absent physician guidance.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8747fdb2-e371-47f5-a072-1104465896c1; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pea
  ('66260d61-03ac-4144-a81c-9009f4ae0c1b', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'use caution while breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b634af09-f9fa-497b-9689-2ba127d6a7d5; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- peppermint-oil
  ('66260d61-03ac-4144-a81c-9009f4ae0c1b', 'children', 'avoid', 'Avoid applying peppermint/menthol products near the face of infants/young children (menthol can trigger laryngospasm).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b634af09-f9fa-497b-9689-2ba127d6a7d5; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- peppermint-oil
  ('66260d61-03ac-4144-a81c-9009f4ae0c1b', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy at medicinal doses', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b634af09-f9fa-497b-9689-2ba127d6a7d5; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- peppermint-oil
  ('c81b9891-bc0c-4851-8a70-85c6f0d19851', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy or breastfeeding due to lack of data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 232bb486-ff1a-4b37-a4cd-dff90e47da11; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- phosphatidylserine
  ('c81b9891-bc0c-4851-8a70-85c6f0d19851', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy or breastfeeding due to lack of data.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 232bb486-ff1a-4b37-a4cd-dff90e47da11; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- phosphatidylserine
  ('4b4502a6-108d-4bac-ba42-4a0e62e9c745', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/breastfeeding - avoid.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links db8cc1d5-0537-4417-af87-befca2ab8d7d; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pine-bark
  ('4b4502a6-108d-4bac-ba42-4a0e62e9c745', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/breastfeeding - avoid.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links db8cc1d5-0537-4417-af87-befca2ab8d7d; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- pine-bark
  ('4b4502a6-108d-4bac-ba42-4a0e62e9c745', 'surgery', 'caution', 'It has vasodilatory/mild blood-pressure-lowering and antiplatelet effects - use caution with antihypertensives, anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, clopidogrel), and around surgery (theoretical bleeding risk | stop ~2 weeks pre-op).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links db8cc1d5-0537-4417-af87-befca2ab8d7d; signal "caution", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- pine-bark
  ('adfdf7ec-6661-4baf-a59f-06b9e1992fb4', 'children', 'avoid', 'SERIOUS RISKS in vulnerable groups: rare but documented bloodstream infections (bacteremia) and fungemia — Saccharomyces boulardii fungemia is specifically linked to patients with central venous catheters — reported in critically ill/ICU patients, the immunocompromised (chemotherapy, HIV, transplant', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e5743943-bed5-40e0-a3be-fa18e7dfef7b, 3417cd19-5a8e-4dac-8e26-14fc374d6ed0; signal "serious risks", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- probiotics
  ('adfdf7ec-6661-4baf-a59f-06b9e1992fb4', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'SERIOUS-RISK GROUPS: live bacteria can rarely cause bloodstream infection (bacteremia/fungemia, including with Saccharomyces boulardii) in people who are immunocompromised, critically ill, have a central venous catheter, short-gut/leaky-gut or recent major GI surgery, or are receiving intensive care', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 04945d7c-172a-46d5-b9f9-690d72c2ce6c; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- probiotics
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Contraindicated in pregnancy and breastfeeding (estrogenic/potential abortifacient constituents).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "contraindicated", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Contraindicated in pregnancy and breastfeeding (estrogenic/potential abortifacient constituents).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "contraindicated", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'stop 2 weeks before surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "stop 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'bleeding_risk', 'caution', 'Antiplatelet/anticoagulant effect — Reishi can inhibit platelet aggregation, so it may increase bleeding risk and should be stopped ~1-2 weeks before surgery and used cautiously with warfarin, aspirin, DOACs, or in bleeding disorders.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "may increase", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/breastfeeding', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'liver', 'avoid', 'a case report describes fatal fulminant hepatitis associated with Reishi powder (Wanmuroong, PMID 17621752), and chronic/powdered forms have been linked to liver injury, so avoid in existing liver disease and monitor if used long-term. | Hepatotoxicity — rare but documented', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "fatal", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/breastfeeding', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'Antiplatelet/anticoagulant effect — Reishi can inhibit platelet aggregation, so it may increase bleeding risk and should be stopped ~1-2 weeks before surgery and used cautiously with warfarin, aspirin, DOACs, or in bleeding disorders.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "stopped 1 2 weeks before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Safety in pregnancy and breastfeeding is not established—avoid. | Safety in pregnancy and breastfeeding is not established — avoid.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20, db76afbc-8f7d-46dc-8a0e-547f0eeb1580, c50405e4-a33e-4838-b04e-e0c13748a15a; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Safety in pregnancy and breastfeeding is not established—avoid. | Safety in pregnancy and breastfeeding is not established — avoid.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20, db76afbc-8f7d-46dc-8a0e-547f0eeb1580, c50405e4-a33e-4838-b04e-e0c13748a15a; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('7cd6b7ef-958a-41d0-bb0a-7091d390760b', 'children', 'avoid', 'Caution/avoid in pregnancy and in premature infants outside of monitored settings.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5da3db9c-c3ba-4bfb-918f-2ffe8331dfd3; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saccharomyces-boulardii
  ('7cd6b7ef-958a-41d0-bb0a-7091d390760b', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Caution/avoid in pregnancy and in premature infants outside of monitored settings.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5da3db9c-c3ba-4bfb-918f-2ffe8331dfd3; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saccharomyces-boulardii
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'avoid in pregnancy and while trying to conceive, and use caution in breastfeeding due to lack of data. | May uterine-stimulate/bleeding risk — avoid in pregnancy (can stimulate the uterus) and use caution when breastfeeding.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Contraindicated in high doses during pregnancy - it is a uterine stimulant (emmenagogue/abortifacient risk) | avoid therapeutic doses if pregnant or trying to conceive.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8222fcae-5b64-415a-9b29-52e8f4fb8924, 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a, ba907e70-e2a3-4d18-9cb4-41332b060b6b, c34e2476-60cb-477d-8e8d-66097a041d58; signal "uterine stimulant", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'surgery', 'avoid', 'May have mild blood-thinning/antiplatelet activity, so use caution with warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel, or other anticoagulants and stop before surgery. | it may add to the effects of sedatives and antihypertensives (mild blood-pressure lowering) and, via mild antiplatelet activity, may increase ble', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8222fcae-5b64-415a-9b29-52e8f4fb8924, 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d; signal "stop before", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('f0c9f60b-471b-4fca-bce2-ba8e94a8928e', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Cautions/contraindications: avoid concentrated/therapeutic sage in pregnancy and breastfeeding (thujone is a uterine stimulant and may reduce milk supply)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b6056e8c-a47f-470e-8299-5dab11dccf9b; signal "uterine stimulant", confidence high', 'draft'), -- sage
  ('f0c9f60b-471b-4fca-bce2-ba8e94a8928e', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Cautions/contraindications: avoid concentrated/therapeutic sage in pregnancy and breastfeeding (thujone is a uterine stimulant and may reduce milk supply)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b6056e8c-a47f-470e-8299-5dab11dccf9b; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- sage
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'Safety in pregnancy/breastfeeding is not established. | Safety in pregnancy/breastfeeding is not well established.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08a9ff87-4bdc-493d-ab25-06b5fa7e3537, ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- same
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Safety in pregnancy/breastfeeding is not established. | Safety in pregnancy/breastfeeding is not well established.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08a9ff87-4bdc-493d-ab25-06b5fa7e3537, ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- same
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'surgery', 'caution', 'caution around surgery and with anticoagulants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- same
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'bleeding_risk', 'caution', 'use caution with peptic ulcer/severe GERD, uncontrolled hypertension, and epilepsy. | Avoid in pregnancy (traditionally uterine-stimulant, except near term in some TCM texts), and use caution in active peptic ulcer, epilepsy, or severe uncontrolled hypertension.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e19c9d7-caed-406e-9ef5-460ce40c5473, 019bab16-e90d-4b67-8993-c67919011c52; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- schisandra
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'liver', 'caution', 'The major, evidence-backed hazard is DRUG INTERACTIONS: Schisandra (especially S. sphenanthera) inhibits CYP3A4 and P-glycoprotein and significantly RAISES blood levels of many prescription drugs - it increased tacrolimus levels 262-339% in liver-transplant patients (Jiang 2010, PMID 20197017).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 019bab16-e90d-4b67-8993-c67919011c52; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- schisandra
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy (traditionally noted to stimulate uterine tone) unless supervised | Avoid in pregnancy (traditionally uterine-stimulant, except near term in some TCM texts), and use caution in active peptic ulcer, epilepsy, or severe uncontrolled hypertension.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e19c9d7-caed-406e-9ef5-460ce40c5473, 019bab16-e90d-4b67-8993-c67919011c52; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- schisandra
  ('4458f5bf-7378-4b0f-a5e0-fb71a7f99d47', 'liver', 'caution', 'Real harm signals at high intake: higher serum selenium (>130 µg/L) is associated with MORE fatty liver and higher ALT (NHANES), and long-term supplementation has been linked to increased type 2 diabetes risk (SELECT and NPC trials) and possible increased non-melanoma skin cancer.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a9301208-c58e-42dc-ac24-8b337472fe50; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- selenium
  ('d12ad79a-c75f-4cf8-aaa6-545647d0013d', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy and breastfeeding (no safety data).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5a49e82b-35e5-438b-a836-4d86e77efc85; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- shilajit
  ('d12ad79a-c75f-4cf8-aaa6-545647d0013d', 'children', 'caution', 'Not studied in adolescents.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5a49e82b-35e5-438b-a836-4d86e77efc85; signal "not studied", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- shilajit
  ('d12ad79a-c75f-4cf8-aaa6-545647d0013d', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy and breastfeeding (no safety data).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5a49e82b-35e5-438b-a836-4d86e77efc85; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- shilajit
  ('219d9030-b0b1-433e-b220-be9ad2022593', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Whole-bark products historically raised theoretical concerns about being an emmenagogue/abortifacient, so it is commonly avoided in pregnancy due to lack of safety data (not because harm is proven).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 95953a07-84f3-4e66-ac57-9907d800f68d; signal "emmenagogue", confidence high', 'draft'), -- slippery-elm
  ('8f47ce78-0eaa-408f-917a-9861facac159', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links bdcb292a-75ea-4180-a621-36ca3d6d6e72; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- st-johns-wort
  ('8f47ce78-0eaa-408f-917a-9861facac159', 'pregnancy', 'avoid', 'Avoid in pregnancy and breastfeeding (insufficient safety data).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links bdcb292a-75ea-4180-a621-36ca3d6d6e72; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- st-johns-wort
  ('7a1518c3-0aa0-4ded-ac08-35b9456ec564', 'breastfeeding', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/lactation at concentrate doses due to lack of data — treat as food, not a validated therapeutic there.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4616f3c1-e32a-4d91-be37-f18001cf767b; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- tart-cherry
  ('7a1518c3-0aa0-4ded-ac08-35b9456ec564', 'kidney', 'caution', 'Cherries are relatively high in potassium — a theoretical consideration in advanced kidney disease.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4616f3c1-e32a-4d91-be37-f18001cf767b; signal "theoretical", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- tart-cherry
  ('7a1518c3-0aa0-4ded-ac08-35b9456ec564', 'pregnancy', 'caution', 'Not established as safe in pregnancy/lactation at concentrate doses due to lack of data — treat as food, not a validated therapeutic there.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 4616f3c1-e32a-4d91-be37-f18001cf767b; signal "not established", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- tart-cherry
  ('e3a4a927-27b4-48b1-9f45-78c7b0668f2d', 'breastfeeding', 'avoid', 'Pregnancy/lactation: culinary amounts are fine, but medicinal/essential-oil doses are not established as safe — avoid concentrated forms.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b0c82861-6cdb-4477-9c20-ed55d68240ab; signal "avoid", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- thyme
