  ('0960f706-b180-46aa-99a1-b7b71bd1c7c9', 'antiretrovirals', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'possible CYP3A4 inhibition, so it can raise levels of many prescription drugs (including protease inhibitors, some statins, immunosuppressants)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e4e44b0f-6aea-4a07-9538-88a756e7509e; signal "can raise", confidence high', 'draft'), -- cats-claw
  ('0960f706-b180-46aa-99a1-b7b71bd1c7c9', 'immunosuppressants', 'caution', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'IMMUNOSTIMULANT — it activates immune pathways, so it is a theoretical/potential problem for people with autoimmune diseases (lupus, MS, RA on biologics) and can oppose immunosuppressant drugs used after organ transplant or for autoimmune disease | possible CYP3A4 inhibition, so it can raise levels ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e4e44b0f-6aea-4a07-9538-88a756e7509e; signal "potential", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- cats-claw
