  ('ec663c7b-9e04-4d96-983f-2dc05e068f96', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'DRUG INTERACTIONS: eugenol has antiplatelet/anticoagulant activity - meaningful bleeding-risk additivity with warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, clopidogrel, NSAIDs, and other antiplatelet/anticoagulant herbs (ginkgo, garlic, fish oil) | people with bleeding disorders or on anticoagulants/antiplatelets', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links cbf9d47f-3964-4b9b-904f-e8382e279c6a; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- clove
