  ('1ce21e30-703c-43c3-b78c-d84327447893', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Key interaction: CoQ10 is structurally similar to vitamin K and can reduce the anticoagulant effect of warfarin (lower INR, higher clot risk) — patients on warfarin should not start it without physician oversight and INR monitoring.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b51c8c7c-2b5a-4365-ad7d-472980f728ce; signal "can reduce", confidence high', 'draft'), -- coq10
  ('1ce21e30-703c-43c3-b78c-d84327447893', 'antihypertensives', 'monitor', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'It may have a mild additive blood-pressure-lowering effect, so watch for hypotension if combined with antihypertensives.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b51c8c7c-2b5a-4365-ad7d-472980f728ce; signal "watch for", confidence high', 'draft'), -- coq10
