  ('53580175-6f82-4543-8a1f-45b28ef03944', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'Dandelion can inhibit/modulate drug-metabolizing enzymes and may affect levels of some medications (e.g., CYP-metabolized and certain antibiotics like ciprofloxacin via chelation of the drug) — separate dosing and review with a pharmacist. | As a diuretic it can also mildly interact with how the kid', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 90f391cb-c402-44ab-b267-dda0402c150f, 93065ded-8231-4adf-b576-98d69c3615d9; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- dandelion-root
  ('53580175-6f82-4543-8a1f-45b28ef03944', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'possible additive effect with anticoagulants/antiplatelets — caution with warfarin', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 90f391cb-c402-44ab-b267-dda0402c150f; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- dandelion-root
  ('53580175-6f82-4543-8a1f-45b28ef03944', 'antidepressants', 'avoid', 'electrolyte or mineral shift', 'diuretic effect can add to prescription diuretics and, in theory, affect lithium levels — avoid combining with lithium without monitoring | It is a genuine (if mild) diuretic and is high in potassium — caution with potassium-sparing diuretics, ACE inhibitors/ARBs, and lithium (diuretics can raise li', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 90f391cb-c402-44ab-b267-dda0402c150f, 93065ded-8231-4adf-b576-98d69c3615d9; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- dandelion-root
