  ('337ee2a9-5ac2-4a9b-bef5-272206642cc1', 'immunosuppressants', 'avoid', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'Theoretical concern with immunosuppressants due to immune-stimulating activity — avoid in transplant patients.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3dfdf8b5-e0f1-4e9b-a52b-178d56021abb; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- eleuthero
  ('337ee2a9-5ac2-4a9b-bef5-272206642cc1', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'has been reported to affect metabolism of some drugs and may alter effects of sedatives, stimulants, and CNS agents.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 3dfdf8b5-e0f1-4e9b-a52b-178d56021abb; signal "may alter", confidence high', 'draft'), -- eleuthero
  ('21805bca-c15a-48f2-ad22-c3d5ed560ecf', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'theoretical interaction with ciprofloxacin (reduced absorption reported) and with anticoagulants', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 97769160-167e-443f-8df7-42b4a500794d; signal "theoretical", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- fennel
  ('21805bca-c15a-48f2-ad22-c3d5ed560ecf', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'theoretical interaction with ciprofloxacin (reduced absorption reported) and with anticoagulants', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 97769160-167e-443f-8df7-42b4a500794d; signal "theoretical", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- fennel
  ('21805bca-c15a-48f2-ad22-c3d5ed560ecf', 'hormonal', 'caution', 'hormonal activity', 'Drug interactions: possible additive effects with estrogen therapy', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 97769160-167e-443f-8df7-42b4a500794d; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- fennel
  ('21805bca-c15a-48f2-ad22-c3d5ed560ecf', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'may enhance sedatives at high doses.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 97769160-167e-443f-8df7-42b4a500794d; signal "may enhance", confidence high', 'draft'), -- fennel
  ('7a29bede-15af-4bb0-b793-5b459fc7bfb3', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'caution with warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, and before surgery. | Bleeding — fenugreek has coumarin-like/antiplatelet activity', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9bfcf9f4-8526-4f31-a9aa-370d32475fc3; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- fenugreek
  ('7a29bede-15af-4bb0-b793-5b459fc7bfb3', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', null, 'can add to diabetes meds (insulin, sulfonylureas).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9bfcf9f4-8526-4f31-a9aa-370d32475fc3; signal "can add", confidence high', 'draft'), -- fenugreek
  ('7a29bede-15af-4bb0-b793-5b459fc7bfb3', 'hormonal', 'caution', 'hormonal activity', 'Hormone-sensitive conditions — it has estrogenic/phytoestrogen activity in women (raises estradiol) so use caution with estrogen-sensitive conditions', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9bfcf9f4-8526-4f31-a9aa-370d32475fc3; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- fenugreek
  ('5b1b5773-094b-469a-a4ba-dc335f6a2e49', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'its proposed mechanism is serotonergic (allosteric modulation of hippocampal 5-HT1A, plus dopaminergic effects), so theoretical caution with serotonergic drugs (SSRIs/SNRIs) — a pilot compared it against, not combined with, sertraline, so co-administration is untested', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e247f41-b7f0-4ba7-b90c-a71af674a629; signal "caution", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- galphimia-glauca
  ('5b1b5773-094b-469a-a4ba-dc335f6a2e49', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive liver strain', 'additive sedation — combining with benzodiazepines, alcohol, opioids, or other CNS depressants may cause excess drowsiness | In the head-to-head trials it was notably BETTER tolerated than benzodiazepines: no dependence, tolerance, intoxication, or withdrawal (suppression) syndrome was observed, and', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e247f41-b7f0-4ba7-b90c-a71af674a629; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- galphimia-glauca
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Antiplatelet/anticoagulant effect - garlic (especially high-dose or concentrated allicin/aged extract) inhibits platelet aggregation and can potentiate warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel, and other blood thinners, raising bleeding risk | caution in bleeding disorders, pre-surgery, on anticoagulants/CYP3', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 539101a3-d2c4-438a-a4eb-e89329320ad1, d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "can potentiate", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Drug interactions: garlic can INDUCE CYP3A4/P-glycoprotein and has been shown to significantly lower blood levels of saquinavir (an HIV protease inhibitor) and may reduce levels of other drugs metabolized this way (some antivirals, cyclosporine, certain statins/calcium-channel blockers) — relevant f', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "may reduce", confidence high', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'antiretrovirals', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Drug interactions beyond bleeding - garlic can induce CYP3A4 and has been shown to reduce plasma levels of the HIV drug saquinavir and may affect other CYP3A4/P-gp substrates (e.g., some protease inhibitors, possibly certain immunosuppressants/statins) | Drug interactions: garlic can INDUCE CYP3A4/P', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 539101a3-d2c4-438a-a4eb-e89329320ad1, d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "may affect", confidence high', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'immunosuppressants', 'caution', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'Drug interactions beyond bleeding - garlic can induce CYP3A4 and has been shown to reduce plasma levels of the HIV drug saquinavir and may affect other CYP3A4/P-gp substrates (e.g., some protease inhibitors, possibly certain immunosuppressants/statins) | Drug interactions: garlic can INDUCE CYP3A4/P', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 539101a3-d2c4-438a-a4eb-e89329320ad1, d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "may affect", confidence high', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'nsaids', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'KEY RISK — bleeding: garlic supplements have antiplatelet activity and can increase bleeding risk, especially combined with warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel, DOACs, or NSAIDs', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "can increase", confidence high', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('0ea8a30d-55c3-401b-b994-885832613afb', 'statins', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Drug interactions beyond bleeding - garlic can induce CYP3A4 and has been shown to reduce plasma levels of the HIV drug saquinavir and may affect other CYP3A4/P-gp substrates (e.g., some protease inhibitors, possibly certain immunosuppressants/statins) | Drug interactions: garlic can INDUCE CYP3A4/P', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 539101a3-d2c4-438a-a4eb-e89329320ad1, d2d843f5-946a-4718-bfa1-e00223dae189; signal "may affect", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- garlic
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'infection risk in vulnerable patients', 'It is not an antibiotic or antifungal in the pharmacologic sense at food/supplement doses in humans.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'It has mild antiplatelet/anticoagulant activity, so use caution and consult a clinician if taking warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, clopidogrel, or other blood thinners, or in the 1-2 weeks before surgery (theoretical bleeding risk). | Bleeding risk: ginger has mild antiplatelet activity and may add to the ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b66150e6-390e-43b7-9c8f-2b1a4eb6aff4, a0a8b10e-5e8f-4b59-a759-4b61572bb6f2, 20541e13-3e59-46ab-a76c-df5710e8de96, f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'May modestly lower blood glucose (caution with insulin/sulfonylureas — monitor for hypoglycemia) and blood pressure (additive with antihypertensives). | May lower blood glucose and blood pressure, so monitor if on antidiabetic or antihypertensive drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b66150e6-390e-43b7-9c8f-2b1a4eb6aff4, a0a8b10e-5e8f-4b59-a759-4b61572bb6f2, 20541e13-3e59-46ab-a76c-df5710e8de96, f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'antifungals', 'caution', 'infection risk in vulnerable patients', 'It is not an antibiotic or antifungal in the pharmacologic sense at food/supplement doses in humans.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('7fba75bc-7d1c-448c-bd42-e0423411cb48', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'May modestly lower blood glucose (caution with insulin/sulfonylureas — monitor for hypoglycemia) and blood pressure (additive with antihypertensives). | May lower blood glucose and blood pressure, so monitor if on antidiabetic or antihypertensive drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b66150e6-390e-43b7-9c8f-2b1a4eb6aff4, a0a8b10e-5e8f-4b59-a759-4b61572bb6f2, 20541e13-3e59-46ab-a76c-df5710e8de96, f71b0dfd-e12e-44fe-83d1-bf8b6e36eae6; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginger
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Avoid or use caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, apixaban, aspirin, clopidogrel), NSAIDs, and stop at least 1-2 weeks before surgery or dental procedures. | Bottom line: the main real risk is bleeding, especially combined with blood thinners or surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'antiepileptics', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Possible interactions via CYP enzymes (e.g., with efavirenz, some anticonvulsants).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "possible", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'antiretrovirals', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Possible interactions via CYP enzymes (e.g., with efavirenz, some anticonvulsants).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "possible", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('94745a64-d0db-41d0-ab72-6750cfadb109', 'nsaids', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Avoid or use caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, apixaban, aspirin, clopidogrel), NSAIDs, and stop at least 1-2 weeks before surgery or dental procedures.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 54224b6d-e318-4e05-8107-313a549adf39; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- ginkgo
  ('5b928596-1e51-44fa-96c1-7e72e03f589f', 'chemotherapy', 'caution', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'As always, separate any supplement regimen review with a clinician if on immunosuppressants or chemotherapy, since glutathione modulates oxidative and immune parameters (NK cytotoxicity rose in the Richie trial).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7214ac0d-2d4c-4e35-95f1-c78714703bb4; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glutathione
  ('5b928596-1e51-44fa-96c1-7e72e03f589f', 'immunosuppressants', 'caution', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'As always, separate any supplement regimen review with a clinician if on immunosuppressants or chemotherapy, since glutathione modulates oxidative and immune parameters (NK cytotoxicity rose in the Richie trial).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7214ac0d-2d4c-4e35-95f1-c78714703bb4; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glutathione
  ('7cb130d2-d6b1-47af-893e-0dd76b1ec415', 'antipsychotics', 'caution', 'altered nitrogen handling', 'glycine is an NMDA-receptor co-agonist, so caution/medical guidance is warranted for anyone on clozapine (glycine may blunt its effect) or other drugs acting on glutamatergic/NMDA pathways', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 53b966fe-0c69-4fe2-a98a-f50c834f4099; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- glycine
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'it may add to the effect of anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel) and should typically be stopped ~2 weeks before surgery. | Bleeding/surgery — tulsi has antiplatelet activity', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a, 49241f60-b6fd-42fc-a5f1-0963db83a331; signal "may add", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'Blood sugar — it can lower blood glucose, so people on antidiabetic drugs or insulin risk additive hypoglycemia and should monitor. | Hypoglycemia — tulsi can lower blood glucose and may add to diabetes medications (monitor if diabetic).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a, 49241f60-b6fd-42fc-a5f1-0963db83a331; signal "can lower", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'Theoretical additive hypotension with blood-pressure medication (the Holixer trial showed BP-lowering).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'nsaids', 'caution', null, 'caution with warfarin, aspirin, or NSAIDs, and stop ~2 weeks before surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'Additive sedation with other CNS depressants/sedatives is plausible. | May potentiate sedatives/CNS depressants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5, 85eb170c-984f-46dc-adbf-aa1d15d7cb0a; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('a3578564-13d3-4d3d-b358-151f4cff7b6c', 'thyroid', 'caution', 'thyroid hormone effect', 'Thyroid — some animal data suggest it may lower thyroxine, so caution with hypothyroidism/thyroid medication.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 478b5d01-90cb-4225-a1c2-bca7ad3a38c5; signal "caution", confidence low', 'draft'), -- holy-basil-tulsi
  ('c0806a98-21b1-4825-ad3c-ebbde8a59b3c', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'additive sedation — can potentiate alcohol, benzodiazepines, other CNS depressants and sedating antihistamines | Possible additive effect with other sedatives and with medications metabolized by the liver', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links aa3111fb-0b71-4059-870f-537da4efa0fa; signal "can potentiate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- hops
  ('443fc77f-e925-4712-839c-05bbd12e67f7', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'theoretical additive/interfering effects with lithium and with serotonergic psychiatric medications mean it should not be self-combined with SSRIs/SNRIs or lithium without medical oversight. | Bipolar disorder — inositol feeds the phosphatidylinositol cycle that lithium is thought to work by depleti', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e9a2b215-0463-4e08-aef5-4de46e014e44; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- inositol
  ('ae041b66-6799-495a-9ac8-df86caab9cf1', 'acid_reducers', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'antacids/proton-pump inhibitors and calcium reduce iron absorption, while vitamin C increases it.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d7d8b979-efef-4b86-bb23-66b68c95d695; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- iron
  ('ae041b66-6799-495a-9ac8-df86caab9cf1', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'Iron reduces absorption of levothyroxine, levodopa, tetracycline/fluoroquinolone antibiotics, and bisphosphonates (separate doses by 2-4 hours)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d7d8b979-efef-4b86-bb23-66b68c95d695; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- iron
  ('ae041b66-6799-495a-9ac8-df86caab9cf1', 'antipsychotics', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'Iron reduces absorption of levothyroxine, levodopa, tetracycline/fluoroquinolone antibiotics, and bisphosphonates (separate doses by 2-4 hours)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d7d8b979-efef-4b86-bb23-66b68c95d695; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- iron
  ('ae041b66-6799-495a-9ac8-df86caab9cf1', 'thyroid', 'caution', 'thyroid hormone effect', 'Iron reduces absorption of levothyroxine, levodopa, tetracycline/fluoroquinolone antibiotics, and bisphosphonates (separate doses by 2-4 hours)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d7d8b979-efef-4b86-bb23-66b68c95d695; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- iron
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'Theoretical caution with drugs metabolized by the liver (herb-drug interaction flagged in the literature) and with monoamine-active drugs given its monoamine effects — caution alongside SSRIs/antidepressants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'Plausible/reported effects: sedation and drowsiness (it is classed as hypno-sedative), and it lowered blood pressure in a hypertension RCT — so it may add to hypotension and to the effect of antihypertensive drugs, and could cause dizziness.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2; signal "may add", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('f4845865-ffad-410b-881f-d2730cd64d25', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'people on blood-pressure or sedative/CNS medications without clinician oversight | Because the animal mechanism is GABA/benzodiazepine-mediated, expect additive CNS depression with alcohol, benzodiazepines, Z-drugs, opioids, sedating antihistamines, and other sedative herbs (valerian, kava, ashwagan', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c015a527-f21a-42f2-b0fb-27892ea78eb2, ae7d9593-4528-4291-9997-14e713f178a8; signal "clinician oversight", confidence high', 'draft'), -- jatamansi
  ('709d86b7-90cd-47ab-9a13-943a9131e912', 'antidepressants', 'avoid', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'John''s Wort, or other serotonergic agents raises a theoretical risk of serotonin syndrome — avoid the combination or use only under clinician supervision. | Because of the SSRI-like action, combining Kanna with SSRIs, SNRIs, MAOIs, tramadol, triptans, St.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8d672117-9d9c-4960-9d89-fb36946c7bee; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- kanna-sceletium
  ('709d86b7-90cd-47ab-9a13-943a9131e912', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'Its PDE4 inhibition and CNS/psychotropic activity mean caution with other CNS depressants, alcohol, and psychiatric medications.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8d672117-9d9c-4960-9d89-fb36946c7bee; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- kanna-sceletium
  ('c56d443f-8eef-40f3-9461-31cf0e30663b', 'acetaminophen', 'avoid', 'additive liver strain', 'Do NOT combine with alcohol, benzodiazepines, barbiturates, other sedatives/CNS depressants, or other hepatotoxic drugs (e.g., acetaminophen, statins, methotrexate).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d875e192-9c79-42a9-af12-6a1b681892a1; signal "do not combine", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- kava
