  ('c56d443f-8eef-40f3-9461-31cf0e30663b', 'sedatives', 'avoid', 'additive sedation', 'Other cautions: do NOT combine with alcohol, benzodiazepines, or other CNS depressants (additive sedation) | Risk may relate to non-aqueous (ethanol/acetone) extracts, use of aerial parts/poor-quality material, high doses, prolonged use, alcohol co-use, and pre-existing liver disease', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 9affddd3-2ee2-4014-bcac-8d2bf3345f1a, d875e192-9c79-42a9-af12-6a1b681892a1; signal "do not combine", confidence high', 'draft'), -- kava
  ('c56d443f-8eef-40f3-9461-31cf0e30663b', 'statins', 'avoid', 'additive liver strain', 'Do NOT combine with alcohol, benzodiazepines, barbiturates, other sedatives/CNS depressants, or other hepatotoxic drugs (e.g., acetaminophen, statins, methotrexate).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links d875e192-9c79-42a9-af12-6a1b681892a1; signal "do not combine", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- kava
  ('69950e62-9bf5-467c-a50d-552b9ae573ad', 'antibiotics', 'caution', null, 'valproate and pivalate-containing antibiotics can cause carnitine depletion (a legitimate deficiency scenario).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 55baefed-81ea-4574-8a18-379ec22c5c68; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- l-carnitine
  ('69950e62-9bf5-467c-a50d-552b9ae573ad', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Consult a clinician if pregnant, on dialysis, on warfarin, or with cardiac or seizure history. | may potentiate the effect of vitamin K antagonists such as warfarin, increasing INR/bleeding risk', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 55baefed-81ea-4574-8a18-379ec22c5c68; signal "consult", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-carnitine
