  ('c958b4d2-dc00-48ea-b7ee-3b58f8178d86', 'antihypertensives', 'avoid', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'Key real risk is additive blood-pressure lowering: do NOT combine with nitrates (nitroglycerin, isosorbide) or PDE5 inhibitors (sildenafil/Viagra, tadalafil/Cialis) without medical supervision, as stacking NO-boosting agents can cause hypotension. | Use caution with antihypertensives for the same re', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ae2c2be1-fb41-4fb6-8c5f-00059511976d; signal "do not combine", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-citrulline
  ('c958b4d2-dc00-48ea-b7ee-3b58f8178d86', 'pde5_inhibitors', 'avoid', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'Key real risk is additive blood-pressure lowering: do NOT combine with nitrates (nitroglycerin, isosorbide) or PDE5 inhibitors (sildenafil/Viagra, tadalafil/Cialis) without medical supervision, as stacking NO-boosting agents can cause hypotension.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ae2c2be1-fb41-4fb6-8c5f-00059511976d; signal "do not combine", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-citrulline
  ('31700ba6-1f47-42fc-a0bb-4257850cd204', 'antiepileptics', 'caution', 'altered nitrogen handling', 'It may theoretically interfere with medications that work by reducing glutamate/ammonia (e.g., lactulose for encephalopathy) and with anti-seizure drugs (weak theoretical concern).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7dd83b11-791c-4903-af69-d9dee8ce0245; signal "theoretical", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- l-glutamine
