  ('5ff51781-b773-467d-bfd4-6f4f29029342', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'theoretical additive sedation with other CNS depressants/anxiolytics/alcohol | it is calming/anxiolytic and can theoretically add to the effect of sedatives, benzodiazepines, sleep aids, or alcohol', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links f78310f1-57f0-4878-b883-a07b33831a16, a7bde884-3f70-4695-9f22-d71c861346e7, b96f0b75-00e8-4460-867c-bc49ba6e429a, e76bbe7d-1b23-4e30-834f-9177c3f84c32; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- l-theanine
  ('5ff51781-b773-467d-bfd4-6f4f29029342', 'stimulants', 'caution', 'additive stimulation', 'stimulant medications may blunt or interact with it.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bde884-3f70-4695-9f22-d71c861346e7; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- l-theanine
  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'use caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets given a theoretical bleeding-risk signal.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08b4e4c6-9923-45bc-a850-3c5af8d57e04; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'Theoretical additive sedation/CNS depression if combined with benzodiazepines, alcohol, or other sedatives, and possible additive effect with other serotonergic/CNS agents — involve a prescriber.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 095802dd-cc8c-4be6-a213-151421a83e53; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('fa11bf59-d93f-42ba-a2ad-da59b051731f', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'Theoretical additive sedation with CNS depressants/other sedatives. | Theoretical additive sedation/CNS depression if combined with benzodiazepines, alcohol, or other sedatives, and possible additive effect with other serotonergic/CNS agents — involve a prescriber.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links e700f5eb-95eb-4114-b765-00936d6ec240, 095802dd-cc8c-4be6-a213-151421a83e53, 08b4e4c6-9923-45bc-a850-3c5af8d57e04; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lavender
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'theoretical reduction of SSRI effectiveness and possible additive effects with GABAergic drugs', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 000522f9-35eb-443d-b7fe-10a0d4dff429; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'Additive sedation with alcohol, benzodiazepines, barbiturates, opioids, and other CNS depressants/sedative herbs (valerian, kava, chamomile). | May lower blood glucose (monitor if diabetic/on hypoglycemics) and has mild sedative-additive potential with barbiturate/anesthetic agents.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bc00ec-84d4-443e-a486-540f21e68188, 000522f9-35eb-443d-b7fe-10a0d4dff429; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('c5311588-3987-413e-b26f-fc20f44c3692', 'thyroid', 'caution', 'thyroid hormone effect', 'potential anti-thyroid activity — may reduce TSH-receptor binding / thyroid signaling, so caution with hypothyroidism or thyroid-hormone replacement | Possible interaction with thyroid: preclinical/traditional reports suggest it may inhibit TSH/thyroid function, so people with hypothyroidism or on l', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a7bc00ec-84d4-443e-a486-540f21e68188, 000522f9-35eb-443d-b7fe-10a0d4dff429; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- lemon-balm
  ('cd0f08db-5ed6-4370-a0c8-06a26e06552c', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Theoretical caution: because bioactive compounds may promote nerve growth factor and it has mild reported antiplatelet/hypoglycemic signals in lab work, use caution combining with anticoagulants or diabetes medication and monitor.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 012b1b47-efb8-4e63-84bc-7ad5723a1857; signal "caution", confidence low', 'draft'), -- lions-mane
