  ('8e2e0162-7f31-45ae-9565-5da55622445d', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'No well-characterized drug interactions, but caution is reasonable with antihypertensives given the blood-pressure signal.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0de64efe-8cce-4dcc-8909-dcb6d7361d94; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- maca
  ('7e98a0a2-38b4-4cc5-b978-dbdfb18736c8', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'reduced or delayed absorption; separate the doses', 'Drug interactions: magnesium binds and reduces absorption of oral tetracycline and fluoroquinolone antibiotics and oral bisphosphonates (separate doses by 2-4+ hours) | Drug interactions: magnesium can reduce absorption of oral tetracycline and fluoroquinolone antibiotics and oral bisphosphonates (s', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links dcada134-7042-4d92-a0df-9e0096776c29, 7c8973cd-eca9-4b14-a426-80ce8d7fe5c8, 569bd48e-d5ee-4fbc-a615-6a87b1b5b236, 68f6c492-1ac9-4428-b8fc-0071a76489f2, af22f51c-70b6-4f7c-aab4-48ba823ed816, 1a335f85-e81d-48b8-b047-fd6c8d857611; signal "separate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- magnesium-glycinate
  ('7e98a0a2-38b4-4cc5-b978-dbdfb18736c8', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'electrolyte or mineral shift', 'caution with potassium-sparing diuretics and in people on digoxin. | caution combining with potassium-sparing diuretics.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links dcada134-7042-4d92-a0df-9e0096776c29, 569bd48e-d5ee-4fbc-a615-6a87b1b5b236, 68f6c492-1ac9-4428-b8fc-0071a76489f2, af22f51c-70b6-4f7c-aab4-48ba823ed816; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- magnesium-glycinate
  ('7e98a0a2-38b4-4cc5-b978-dbdfb18736c8', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'high doses may add to the effects of blood-pressure or muscle-relaxant drugs. | high-dose magnesium may add to the effects of other CNS depressants and neuromuscular blockers', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 7c8973cd-eca9-4b14-a426-80ce8d7fe5c8, 569bd48e-d5ee-4fbc-a615-6a87b1b5b236, 1a335f85-e81d-48b8-b047-fd6c8d857611; signal "may add", confidence high', 'draft'), -- magnesium-glycinate
  ('ba101923-308e-49f0-a973-8e65ce4a41e3', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Possible additive effect with anticoagulants/antiplatelets and blood-pressure or blood-sugar-lowering agents is plausible and under-studied. | Preclinical data suggest possible CYP450 modulation and antiplatelet activity, so caution with anticoagulants/antiplatelets and narrow-therapeutic-index drug', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c0847bb2-2e28-4b66-bc01-9fae6263c035, dfceae56-7572-463d-ab1f-7bd1cce60c8a; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- magnolia-bark
  ('ba101923-308e-49f0-a973-8e65ce4a41e3', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'Because the mechanism is benzodiazepine-site GABA-A modulation, expect additive sedation/CNS depression with alcohol, benzodiazepines, other sedative-hypnotics, and possibly with other GABAergic supplements — a real concern in veterans on sleep or anxiety medication. | Because magnolol/honokiol are ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links c0847bb2-2e28-4b66-bc01-9fae6263c035, dfceae56-7572-463d-ab1f-7bd1cce60c8a; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- magnolia-bark
  ('8cdaf458-ba70-4af5-8837-653a13ea62f1', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Because it is unstudied in humans for these uses, there are NO characterized drug interactions — a real gap for veterans on VA prescriptions (e.g., anticoagulants, hepatically metabolized drugs, psychiatric meds)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 71bb22cb-f6a7-4b07-b95f-18fada8b5236; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- manjistha
