  ('0af17207-3c03-4652-bda5-3ebf7474024a', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'IMPORTANT drug-interaction caveat: silymarin can inhibit CYP2C9 and some UGT/P-glycoprotein activity in lab studies, so it can theoretically raise levels of CYP2C9 substrates (e.g., warfarin, some statins, certain diabetes drugs) | clinical significance is usually modest but matters for veterans on ', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a451b1a7-617b-4221-bd9b-55810ad85c55; signal "theoretically", confidence low', 'draft'), -- milk-thistle
  ('0af17207-3c03-4652-bda5-3ebf7474024a', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'Mild blood-sugar-lowering effect has been seen in diabetics, so watch for additive effects with glucose-lowering drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a451b1a7-617b-4221-bd9b-55810ad85c55; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- milk-thistle
