  ('388985fd-110e-425e-9c55-0aa70325f43d', 'thyroid', 'monitor', 'thyroid hormone effect', 'relevant for drugs with narrow therapeutic index such as levothyroxine, lithium, carbamazepine, digoxin, and some diabetes meds — note psyllium can independently lower post-meal glucose, so watch for additive hypoglycemia in insulin/sulfonylurea users).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 79ccd860-66c7-45f8-8d26-eb330b582a6f; signal "watch for", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- psyllium
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Bleeding — contains coumarin-type constituents and may add to the effect of anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, DOACs, aspirin, clopidogrel)', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "may add", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'chemotherapy', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Interactions — may interact with hormone therapy/oral contraceptives, tamoxifen and other hormonal agents, and theoretically with CYP-metabolized drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "may interact", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('cb8a73dd-21b9-4602-abce-1a898242d1f9', 'hormonal', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Interactions — may interact with hormone therapy/oral contraceptives, tamoxifen and other hormonal agents, and theoretically with CYP-metabolized drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 0ffc102d-3d11-48af-a17d-903f6afa0c91; signal "may interact", confidence high', 'draft'), -- red-clover
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Antiplatelet/anticoagulant effect — Reishi can inhibit platelet aggregation, so it may increase bleeding risk and should be stopped ~1-2 weeks before surgery and used cautiously with warfarin, aspirin, DOACs, or in bleeding disorders.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "may increase", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'May additively lower blood pressure and blood glucose — caution with antihypertensives and antidiabetic drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive blood-pressure or heart-rate lowering', 'May additively lower blood pressure and blood glucose — caution with antihypertensives and antidiabetic drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('5f544c31-100f-4a0b-a77c-b16129caba0d', 'immunosuppressants', 'avoid', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'May theoretically blunt immunosuppressants (e.g., post-transplant) — avoid there.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e07ff47-b0b3-4f9c-88f0-854f45534451; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- reishi
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'It may have mild blood-pressure and blood-sugar effects and possible antiplatelet activity—use caution with antihypertensives, antidiabetics, and anticoagulant/antiplatelet drugs. | may inhibit CYP-metabolizing enzymes in vitro (unclear clinical relevance) so use caution with narrow-therapeutic-inde', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'antidepressants', 'avoid', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'Theoretical concerns include additive effects or interactions with stimulants and with serotonergic/MAO-inhibiting drugs (avoid combining with MAOIs | use caution with antidepressants).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20, db76afbc-8f7d-46dc-8a0e-547f0eeb1580, c50405e4-a33e-4838-b04e-e0c13748a15a; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'It may have mild blood-pressure and blood-sugar effects and possible antiplatelet activity—use caution with antihypertensives, antidiabetics, and anticoagulant/antiplatelet drugs. | may lower blood pressure or blood sugar, so monitor if on antihypertensives or diabetes medication', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, db76afbc-8f7d-46dc-8a0e-547f0eeb1580; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
