  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'immunosuppressants', 'caution', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'may inhibit CYP-metabolizing enzymes in vitro (unclear clinical relevance) so use caution with narrow-therapeutic-index drugs (e.g., some anticoagulants, immunosuppressants).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20; signal "caution", confidence low', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('6115b774-abe2-4f7b-81dd-f1b8d7e8533a', 'stimulants', 'caution', 'additive stimulation', 'Theoretical concerns include additive effects or interactions with stimulants and with serotonergic/MAO-inhibiting drugs (avoid combining with MAOIs | Theoretical interactions: may add to the effects of other stimulants', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links a3a57cc5-1a03-41d7-936e-f5b2e07f0f60, 83d8dab5-642f-4364-b162-f1a8c691eb20, db76afbc-8f7d-46dc-8a0e-547f0eeb1580, c50405e4-a33e-4838-b04e-e0c13748a15a; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- rhodiola-rosea
  ('7cd6b7ef-958a-41d0-bb0a-7091d390760b', 'antibiotics', 'caution', 'additive stimulation', 'Because it is a yeast, it is NOT killed by antibacterial antibiotics (an advantage for co-administration) but IS inactivated by systemic or oral antifungals (e.g., fluconazole, nystatin) — do not co-administer with antifungal therapy.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5da3db9c-c3ba-4bfb-918f-2ffe8331dfd3; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- saccharomyces-boulardii
  ('7cd6b7ef-958a-41d0-bb0a-7091d390760b', 'antifungals', 'caution', 'additive stimulation', 'Because it is a yeast, it is NOT killed by antibacterial antibiotics (an advantage for co-administration) but IS inactivated by systemic or oral antifungals (e.g., fluconazole, nystatin) — do not co-administer with antifungal therapy.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5da3db9c-c3ba-4bfb-918f-2ffe8331dfd3; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- saccharomyces-boulardii
  ('7cd6b7ef-958a-41d0-bb0a-7091d390760b', 'immunosuppressants', 'avoid', 'immune effects may add to or oppose the drug', 'Documented risk in the critically ill, immunocompromised, those with central venous catheters, and enterally fed patients — AVOID in these groups', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 5da3db9c-c3ba-4bfb-918f-2ffe8331dfd3; signal "avoid", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saccharomyces-boulardii
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'May have mild blood-thinning/antiplatelet activity, so use caution with warfarin, aspirin, clopidogrel, or other anticoagulants and stop before surgery. | it may add to the effects of sedatives and antihypertensives (mild blood-pressure lowering) and, via mild antiplatelet activity, may increase ble', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8222fcae-5b64-415a-9b29-52e8f4fb8924, 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a, ba907e70-e2a3-4d18-9cb4-41332b060b6b, c34e2476-60cb-477d-8e8d-66097a041d58; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'additive stimulation', 'People with bipolar disorder should be cautious (theoretical mood-activation/manic-switch risk shared with other antidepressant-type agents). | Drug interactions: because saffron shows antidepressant-like (possible serotonergic/monoamine) activity, combining it with SSRIs/SNRIs/MAOIs carries a theor', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a, ba907e70-e2a3-4d18-9cb4-41332b060b6b, c34e2476-60cb-477d-8e8d-66097a041d58; signal "risk", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'antidiabetics', 'monitor', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'May lower blood pressure and blood sugar (monitor if on antihypertensives or diabetes meds).', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a; signal "monitor", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'antihypertensives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'May potentiate sedatives and blood-pressure-lowering drugs. | it may add to the effects of sedatives and antihypertensives (mild blood-pressure lowering) and, via mild antiplatelet activity, may increase bleeding risk with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, aspirin, NSAIDs) or around surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8222fcae-5b64-415a-9b29-52e8f4fb8924, 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, ad42c852-8d57-4821-8d7b-969314ce484a, ba907e70-e2a3-4d18-9cb4-41332b060b6b, c34e2476-60cb-477d-8e8d-66097a041d58; signal "may potentiate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'nsaids', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'it may add to the effects of sedatives and antihypertensives (mild blood-pressure lowering) and, via mild antiplatelet activity, may increase bleeding risk with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, aspirin, NSAIDs) or around surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d; signal "may increase", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('5ca93d34-90bc-44ef-a023-ba0f2f0ac9cc', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'May potentiate sedatives and blood-pressure-lowering drugs. | it may add to the effects of sedatives and antihypertensives (mild blood-pressure lowering) and, via mild antiplatelet activity, may increase bleeding risk with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (warfarin, aspirin, NSAIDs) or around surgery.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 8222fcae-5b64-415a-9b29-52e8f4fb8924, 979bcd89-c84e-4b2b-b154-210d2176ea8d, c34e2476-60cb-477d-8e8d-66097a041d58; signal "may potentiate", confidence high', 'draft'), -- saffron
  ('f0c9f60b-471b-4fca-bce2-ba8e94a8928e', 'antidiabetics', 'caution', 'additive blood-sugar lowering', 'sage may lower blood glucose (watch with diabetes medications) and may lower blood pressure', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b6056e8c-a47f-470e-8299-5dab11dccf9b; signal "may lower", confidence high', 'draft'), -- sage
  ('f0c9f60b-471b-4fca-bce2-ba8e94a8928e', 'antiepileptics', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'theoretical additive effect with cholinesterase-inhibitor drugs (e.g., donepezil) and possible interaction with sedatives and anticonvulsants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b6056e8c-a47f-470e-8299-5dab11dccf9b; signal "additive", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- sage
  ('f0c9f60b-471b-4fca-bce2-ba8e94a8928e', 'sedatives', 'caution', 'additive sedation', 'theoretical additive effect with cholinesterase-inhibitor drugs (e.g., donepezil) and possible interaction with sedatives and anticonvulsants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links b6056e8c-a47f-470e-8299-5dab11dccf9b; signal "additive", confidence high', 'draft'), -- sage
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Also use caution with anticoagulant/antiplatelet drugs (theoretical bleeding effect), in Parkinson''s (may interact with levodopa), and it can lower blood levels of some drugs. | caution around surgery and with anticoagulants.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08a9ff87-4bdc-493d-ab25-06b5fa7e3537, ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- same
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'antidepressants', 'avoid', 'serotonergic overlap (serotonin syndrome risk)', 'Do not combine with prescription antidepressants without medical supervision. | Serotonin syndrome — SAMe raises central serotonergic tone and can add to SSRIs/SNRIs, MAOIs, tramadol, triptans, and other serotonergic drugs', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08a9ff87-4bdc-493d-ab25-06b5fa7e3537, ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "do not combine", confidence high', 'draft'), -- same
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'antipsychotics', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Also use caution with anticoagulant/antiplatelet drugs (theoretical bleeding effect), in Parkinson''s (may interact with levodopa), and it can lower blood levels of some drugs.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 08a9ff87-4bdc-493d-ab25-06b5fa7e3537; signal "may interact", confidence high', 'draft'), -- same
  ('77db6768-9980-41eb-a289-d61acdec237c', 'nsaids', 'caution', null, 'It does NOT repair cartilage or modify joint structure (no disease-modifying evidence), and it does not clearly outperform a placebo for pain — its realistic role is an NSAID-comparable analgesic with a gentler GI profile, not a cure for arthritis or inflammation.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links ce29061c-5afa-41c2-84d7-5400844b2d5e; signal "none", confidence low', 'draft'), -- same
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Use caution with narrow-therapeutic-index drugs (immunosuppressants, warfarin, some statins, midazolam). | This means it can push levels of statins, calcineurin inhibitors, some benzodiazepines, warfarin, and other CYP3A substrates into toxic ranges.', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e19c9d7-caed-406e-9ef5-460ce40c5473, 019bab16-e90d-4b67-8993-c67919011c52; signal "caution", confidence high', 'draft'), -- schisandra
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'antidepressants', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Key real concern is drug interactions: Schisandra lignans modulate cytochrome P450 (notably CYP3A4) and P-glycoprotein, and can raise or lower blood levels of many drugs — it has been shown to significantly increase tacrolimus concentrations (relevant to transplant patients, including lung transplan', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e19c9d7-caed-406e-9ef5-460ce40c5473; signal "can raise", confidence medium', 'draft'), -- schisandra
  ('78797d94-a08a-485e-a847-193d99363936', 'immunosuppressants', 'caution', 'changes the drug''s blood level (liver enzyme or transporter interaction)', 'Key real concern is drug interactions: Schisandra lignans modulate cytochrome P450 (notably CYP3A4) and P-glycoprotein, and can raise or lower blood levels of many drugs — it has been shown to significantly increase tacrolimus concentrations (relevant to transplant patients, including lung transplan', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 1e19c9d7-caed-406e-9ef5-460ce40c5473, 019bab16-e90d-4b67-8993-c67919011c52; signal "can raise", confidence high', 'draft'), -- schisandra
