  ('4458f5bf-7378-4b0f-a5e0-fb71a7f99d47', 'anticoagulants', 'caution', 'additive bleeding risk', 'Selenium may interact with certain chemotherapy agents and with anticoagulants/antiplatelets (theoretical bleeding risk at high doses). | Interactions/contraindications: caution with anticoagulants (theoretical bleeding), and additive toxicity if combined with other selenium sources or multivitamins', 'rule-based extraction from atlas_links.safety_note by scripts/draft-safety-rows.mjs (no model); links 087de55f-9cf2-432d-9c35-b8ab5d71b0b2, a9301208-c58e-42dc-ac24-8b337472fe50; signal "may interact", confidence high', 'draft'), -- selenium
